{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2009,"convocatoria":"Reserva 1","documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d\\). Calcula los valores de \\(a\\), \\(b\\), \\(c\\) y \\(d\\) sabiendo que \\(f\\) verifica: el punto \\((0,1)\\) es un punto de inflexión de la gráfica de \\(f\\); \\(f\\) tiene un mínimo local en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\); la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=2\\) tiene pendiente 1.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=3ax^2+2bx+c,\\qquad f''(x)=6ax+2b\\]<p>• \\((0,1)\\) está en la gráfica: \\(f(0)=d=1\\).</p><p>• Inflexión en \\(x=0\\): \\(f''(0)=2b=0\\Rightarrow b=0\\).</p><p>• Mínimo en \\(x=1\\): \\(f'(1)=3a+c=0\\).</p><p>• Pendiente 1 en \\(x=2\\): \\(f'(2)=12a+c=1\\).</p><p>Restando: \\(9a=1\\Rightarrow a=\\frac19\\), \\(c=-\\frac13\\). Comprobación: \\(f''(1)=6a=\\frac23\\gt0\\), es mínimo ✓.</p><div class='res'>\\(a=\\dfrac19\\), \\(b=0\\), \\(c=-\\dfrac13\\), \\(d=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera las funciones \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=|x|\\), \\(g(x)=6-x^2\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por sus gráficas.","(1,5 p.) Calcula el área de dicho recinto."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(g\\) es una parábola hacia abajo con vértice en \\((0,6)\\); \\(f(x)=|x|\\) es una «V» con vértice en el origen. Ambas son pares. Cortes (para \\(x\\geq0\\)): \\(x=6-x^2\\iff x^2+x-6=0\\iff x=2\\); por simetría, también \\(x=-2\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='68.8,126.2 72.8,118.0 76.9,110.1 80.9,102.7 85.0,95.7 89.1,89.1 93.1,82.9 97.2,77.2 101.2,71.8 105.3,67.0 109.4,62.5 113.4,58.5 117.5,54.9 121.6,51.7 125.6,48.9 129.7,46.6 133.8,44.7 137.8,43.2 141.9,42.1 145.9,41.5 150.0,41.2 154.1,41.5 158.1,42.1 162.2,43.2 166.2,44.7 170.3,46.6 174.4,48.9 178.4,51.7 182.5,54.8 186.6,58.5 190.6,62.5 194.7,67.0 198.8,71.9 202.8,77.2 206.9,82.9 210.9,89.1 215.0,95.7 219.1,102.7 223.1,110.1 227.2,118.0 231.2,126.2 231.2,126.2 227.2,128.4 223.1,130.5 219.1,132.6 215.0,134.8 210.9,136.9 206.9,139.0 202.8,141.1 198.8,143.2 194.7,145.4 190.6,147.5 186.6,149.6 182.5,151.8 178.4,153.9 174.4,156.0 170.3,158.1 166.2,160.2 162.2,162.4 158.1,164.5 154.1,166.6 150.0,168.8 145.9,166.6 141.9,164.5 137.8,162.4 133.8,160.2 129.7,158.1 125.6,156.0 121.6,153.9 117.5,151.8 113.4,149.6 109.4,147.5 105.3,145.4 101.2,143.2 97.2,141.1 93.1,139.0 89.1,136.9 85.0,134.8 80.9,132.6 76.9,130.5 72.8,128.4 68.8,126.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='36.3,207.8 40.0,196.9 43.8,186.4 47.6,176.2 51.4,166.4 55.2,156.9 59.0,147.9 62.8,139.2 66.6,130.8 70.4,122.9 74.2,115.3 78.0,108.1 81.8,101.2 85.5,94.7 89.3,88.6 93.1,82.9 96.9,77.5 100.7,72.5 104.5,67.9 108.3,63.6 112.1,59.8 115.9,56.2 119.7,53.1 123.5,50.3 127.2,47.9 131.0,45.9 134.8,44.2 138.6,42.9 142.4,42.0 146.2,41.4 150.0,41.2 153.8,41.4 157.6,42.0 161.4,42.9 165.2,44.2 169.0,45.9 172.8,47.9 176.5,50.3 180.3,53.1 184.1,56.2 187.9,59.8 191.7,63.6 195.5,67.9 199.3,72.5 203.1,77.5 206.9,82.9 210.7,88.6 214.5,94.7 218.2,101.2 222.0,108.1 225.8,115.3 229.6,122.9 233.4,130.8 237.2,139.2 241.0,147.9 244.8,156.9 248.6,166.4 252.4,176.2 256.2,186.4 260.0,196.9 263.8,207.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,100.8 106.7,146.1 193.3,146.1 280.0,100.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='68.8' cy='126.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='22.8' y='122.2'>(−2,2)</text><circle cx='231.2' cy='126.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='237.2' y='122.2'>(2,2)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 168.8H294.0M150.0 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='68.8' y1='165.8' x2='68.8' y2='171.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='65.8' y='182.8' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='231.2' y1='165.8' x2='231.2' y2='171.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='228.2' y='182.8' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='126.2' x2='153.0' y2='126.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='130.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='41.2' x2='153.0' y2='41.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='45.2' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por la simetría respecto de \\(OY\\), calculo el doble de la mitad derecha, donde \\(g\\) va por encima:</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^2\\bigl(6-x^2-x\\bigr)dx=2\\Bigl[6x-\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac{x^2}2\\Bigr]_0^2=2\\left(12-\\frac83-2\\right)=\\frac{44}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{44}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Tratamos de adivinar, mediante ciertas pistas, los precios de tres productos \\(A\\), \\(B\\) y \\(C\\). Pista 1: si compramos una unidad de \\(A\\), dos de \\(B\\) y una de \\(C\\) gastamos 118 euros. Pista 2: si compramos \\(n\\) unidades de \\(A\\), \\(n+3\\) de \\(B\\) y tres de \\(C\\) gastamos 390 euros.","apartados":["(1,5 p.) ¿Hay algún valor de \\(n\\) para el que estas dos pistas sean incompatibles?","(1 p.) Sabiendo que \\(n=4\\) y que el producto \\(C\\) cuesta el triple que el producto \\(A\\), calcula el precio de cada producto."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Sean \\(a\\), \\(b\\), \\(c\\) los precios de \\(A\\), \\(B\\) y \\(C\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}a+2b+c=118\\\\na+(n+3)b+3c=390\\end{cases}\\]<p>Con dos ecuaciones y tres incógnitas, el sistema solo es incompatible si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=1\\lt\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>: las filas de coeficientes \\((1,2,1)\\) y \\((n,n+3,3)\\) han de ser proporcionales. Por la tercera componente, la razón es 3: \\(n=3\\) y \\(n+3=6\\) ✓. Con \\(n=3\\), la 2.ª ecuación es \\(3a+6b+3c=390\\), es decir, \\(a+2b+c=130\\), que contradice \\(a+2b+c=118\\).</p><div class='res'>Sí: para \\(n=3\\) las pistas son incompatibles</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(n=4\\) y \\(c=3a\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}a+2b+3a=118\\\\4a+7b+9a=390\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}2a+b=59\\\\13a+7b=390\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1\\\\13&7\\end{vmatrix}=1\\]\\[a=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}59&1\\\\390&7\\end{vmatrix}}{1}=23\\]\\[b=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}2&59\\\\13&390\\end{vmatrix}}{1}=13\\]<p>Y \\(c=3a=69\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(A\\): 23 €, \\(B\\): 13 €, \\(C\\): 69 €</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(23+26+69=118\\) y \\(92+91+207=390\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"plan","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el punto \\(A(1,-2,1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) definida por las ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}x+y=2\\\\2x+y+z=7\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano perpendicular a \\(r\\) que pasa por \\(A\\).","(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia del punto \\(A\\) a la recta \\(r\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Director de \\(r\\): \\((1,1,0)\\times(2,1,1)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&1&0\\\\2&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,-1,-1)\\). Con \\(x=0\\): \\(y=2\\), \\(z=5\\). Así \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,2-t,\\,5-t)\\).</p><p>El plano es perpendicular a \\(r\\): su normal es \\((1,-1,-1)\\), de la forma \\(x-y-z+D=0\\). Pasa por \\(A\\): \\(1+2-1+D=0\\iff D=-2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x-y-z-2=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Corte de \\(r\\) con ese plano: \\(t-(2-t)-(5-t)-2=0\\iff3t=9\\iff t=3\\): \\(M(3,-1,2)\\), pie de la perpendicular desde \\(A\\).</p>\\[d(A,r)=|\\overrightarrow{AM}|=|(2,1,1)|=\\sqrt6\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":84,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[3.558,-0.851,2.408],[1.351,-3.058,2.408],[-1.058,-0.649,-2.408],[1.149,1.558,-2.408]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-1.058,-0.649,-2.408],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.6,0.4,3.4],[4.4,-2.4,0.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.4,-2.4,0.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,-2,1],[3,-1,2],\"#e11d48\",1.6,false],[\"line\",[3.231,-1.231,1.769],[2.904,-1.394,1.606],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.904,-1.394,1.606],[2.673,-1.163,1.837],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,-2,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,-1,2],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='62.4,53.9 134.0,18.0 230.4,210.1 158.8,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='234.4' y='210.1' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='138.1' y1='36.3' x2='26.0' y2='92.6' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='92.6' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='150.7' y1='79.9' x2='82.1' y2='64.5' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='72.8' y1='69.1' x2='84.0' y2='71.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='84.0' y1='71.6' x2='93.3' y2='67.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='150.7' cy='79.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='157.7' y='73.9' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='82.1' cy='64.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='89.1' y='58.5' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.1' y2='270.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.5' y='274.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='25.7' y2='276.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='23.3' y='282.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(A,r)=\\sqrt6\\approx2{,}45\\) unidades</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"perp","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se divide un segmento de longitud \\(L=20\\) cm en dos trozos. Con uno de los trozos se forma un cuadrado y con el otro un rectángulo en el que la base es el doble de la altura. Calcula la longitud de cada uno de los trozos para que la suma de las áreas del cuadrado y del rectángulo sea mínima.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Sea \\(x\\) el trozo del cuadrado y \\(20-x\\) el del rectángulo, con \\(0\\lt x\\lt20\\).</p><p><b>Cuadrado:</b> lado \\(\\frac x4\\), área \\(\\frac{x^2}{16}\\). <b>Rectángulo:</b> altura \\(h\\), base \\(2h\\); \\(6h=20-x\\Rightarrow h=\\frac{20-x}6\\); área \\(2h^2=\\frac{(20-x)^2}{18}\\).</p>\\[S(x)=\\frac{x^2}{16}+\\frac{(20-x)^2}{18}\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(S'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[S'(x)=\\frac x8-\\frac{20-x}9=\\frac{17x-160}{72}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=\\frac{160}{17}}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>160/17</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>20</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>S</tspan>′(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M139.0 40L175.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 11L175.0 10L173.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>S</tspan>′(15) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(S\\) decrece en \\(\\left(0,\\frac{160}{17}\\right)\\) debido a que \\(S'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\(\\left(\\frac{160}{17},20\\right)\\) debido a que \\(S'(x)\\gt0\\): mínimo absoluto en \\(x=\\frac{160}{17}\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Trozo del cuadrado \\(\\dfrac{160}{17}\\approx9{,}41\\) cm; trozo del rectángulo \\(\\dfrac{180}{17}\\approx10{,}59\\) cm</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"La recta tangente a la gráfica de la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\), definida por \\(f(x)=mx^2+nx-3\\), en el punto \\((1,-6)\\), es paralela a la recta de ecuación \\(y=-x\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Determina las constantes \\(m\\) y \\(n\\). Halla la ecuación de dicha recta tangente.","(1,25 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de la función, la recta tangente anterior y el eje de ordenadas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Pasa por \\((1,-6)\\): \\(m+n-3=-6\\iff m+n=-3\\). Pendiente \\(-1\\) en \\(x=1\\): \\(f'(1)=2m+n=-1\\). Restando: \\(m=2\\), \\(n=-5\\).</p>\\[y+6=-(x-1)\\iff y=-x-5\\]<div class='res'>\\(m=2\\), \\(n=-5\\); tangente \\(y=-x-5\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(x)=2x^2-5x-3\\) es convexa y queda por encima de la tangente. El recinto va del eje de ordenadas (\\(x=0\\)) al punto de tangencia (\\(x=1\\)):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='67.3,110.0 68.8,112.0 70.2,114.0 71.7,116.0 73.2,117.9 74.7,119.7 76.1,121.5 77.6,123.3 79.1,125.1 80.6,126.8 82.0,128.4 83.5,130.0 85.0,131.6 86.5,133.1 88.0,134.6 89.4,136.1 90.9,137.5 92.4,138.9 93.9,140.2 95.3,141.5 96.8,142.7 98.3,143.9 99.8,145.1 101.2,146.2 102.7,147.3 104.2,148.4 105.7,149.4 107.2,150.3 108.6,151.2 110.1,152.1 111.6,153.0 113.1,153.8 114.5,154.5 116.0,155.2 117.5,155.9 119.0,156.5 120.5,157.1 121.9,157.7 123.4,158.2 124.9,158.7 126.4,159.1 126.4,159.1 124.9,158.7 123.4,158.3 121.9,157.9 120.5,157.5 119.0,157.0 117.5,156.6 116.0,156.2 114.5,155.8 113.1,155.4 111.6,155.0 110.1,154.6 108.6,154.2 107.2,153.8 105.7,153.4 104.2,153.0 102.7,152.5 101.2,152.1 99.8,151.7 98.3,151.3 96.8,150.9 95.3,150.5 93.9,150.1 92.4,149.7 90.9,149.3 89.4,148.9 88.0,148.5 86.5,148.0 85.0,147.6 83.5,147.2 82.0,146.8 80.6,146.4 79.1,146.0 77.6,145.6 76.1,145.2 74.7,144.8 73.2,144.4 71.7,144.0 70.2,143.5 68.8,143.1 67.3,142.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='25.9,36.7 30.0,45.5 34.2,53.9 38.3,62.1 42.5,69.9 46.6,77.4 50.7,84.5 54.9,91.4 59.0,97.9 63.1,104.1 67.3,110.0 71.4,115.6 75.5,120.8 79.7,125.7 83.8,130.3 88.0,134.6 92.1,138.6 96.2,142.2 100.4,145.6 104.5,148.6 108.6,151.2 112.8,153.6 116.9,155.6 121.0,157.4 125.2,158.8 129.3,159.8 133.5,160.6 137.6,161.0 141.7,161.1 145.9,160.9 150.0,160.4 154.1,159.6 158.3,158.4 162.4,156.9 166.5,155.1 170.7,153.0 174.8,150.5 179.0,147.7 183.1,144.6 187.2,141.2 191.4,137.5 195.5,133.4 199.6,129.1 203.8,124.4 207.9,119.3 212.0,114.0 216.2,108.4 220.3,102.4 224.5,96.1 228.6,89.5 232.7,82.5 236.9,75.2 241.0,67.7 245.1,59.8 249.3,51.5 253.4,43.0 257.5,34.1 261.7,24.9 265.8,15.4 270.0,5.6 274.1,-4.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,129.6 132.3,160.7 244.5,191.8' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='126.4' cy='159.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='132.4' y='173.1'>(1,−6)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 60.9H294.0M67.3 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='126.4' y1='57.9' x2='126.4' y2='63.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='123.4' y='74.9' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='185.5' y1='57.9' x2='185.5' y2='63.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='182.5' y='74.9' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='244.5' y1='57.9' x2='244.5' y2='63.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='241.5' y='74.9' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='64.3' y1='159.1' x2='70.3' y2='159.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='51.3' y='163.1' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='64.3' y1='110.0' x2='70.3' y2='110.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='51.3' y='114.0' font-size='10'>-3</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^1\\bigl(2x^2-5x-3-(-x-5)\\bigr)dx=\\int_0^12(x-1)^2\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{2(x-1)^3}3\\Bigr]_0^1=0-\\left(-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac23\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac23\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(A\\), \\(B\\), \\(C\\) y \\(X\\) matrices cualesquiera que verifican \\(AXB=C\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Si las matrices son cuadradas de orden 3, y se sabe que el determinante de \\(A\\) es 3, el de \\(B\\) es \\(-1\\) y el de \\(C\\) es 6, calcula el determinante de las matrices \\(X\\) y \\(2X\\).","(1,5 p.) Si \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\0&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\2&-3\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}0&3\\\\4&2\\end{pmatrix}\\) calcula la matriz \\(X\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por \\(|MN|=|M||N|\\): \\(|A||X||B|=|C|\\iff3\\cdot|X|\\cdot(-1)=6\\iff|X|=-2\\).</p><p>\\(|2X|=2^3|X|\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(M\\) es de orden \\(n\\), \\(|kM|=k^n|M|\\): cada una de las \\(n\\) filas queda multiplicada por \\(k\\).</i>\\(=8\\cdot(-2)=-16\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(|X|=-2\\) y \\(|2X|=-16\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(|A|=-2\\neq0\\) y \\(|B|=-3+4=1\\neq0\\): ambas son invertibles y \\(X=A^{-1}CB^{-1}\\).</p>\\[A^{-1}=-\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}-2&-1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\\\0 & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad B^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\\\0 & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 3\\\\4 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 4\\\\-2 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 2\\\\-2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-14 & 8\\\\8 & -5\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}-14 & 8\\\\8 & -5\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"det","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-1-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(\\begin{cases}y=-1\\\\2x-z=2\\end{cases}\\) y la recta \\(s\\) definida por \\(\\begin{cases}x=4+3\\lambda\\\\y=3-\\lambda\\\\z=5+4\\lambda\\end{cases}\\). Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y es paralelo a \\(s\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): \\(y=-1\\), \\(z=2x-2\\). Con \\(x=t\\): \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,-1,\\,-2+2t)\\), por \\(R(0,-1,-2)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(1,0,2)\\). \\(s\\) tiene director \\(\\vec v=(3,-1,4)\\).</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&0&2\\\\3&-1&4\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,2,\\,-1)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(2x+2y-z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(0-2+2+D=0\\iff D=0\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-135,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.236,1.471,2.471],[3.471,-2.236,2.471],[2.236,-3.471,-2.471],[-1.471,0.236,-2.471]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.236,-3.471,-2.471],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-0.5,-1.0,-3.0],[2.5,-1.0,3.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.5,-1.0,3.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.4,4.2,0.2],[5.2,2.6,6.6],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[5.2,2.6,6.6],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r1b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r1b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r1b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r1b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='55.7,129.7 160.9,129.7 160.9,234.8 55.7,234.8' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='164.9' y='234.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='87.0' y1='246.0' x2='129.6' y2='118.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='135.6' y='118.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='154.1' x2='116.8' y2='18.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='122.8' y='18.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='265.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='268.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.7' y2='265.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='5.7' y='268.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(2x+2y-z=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(s\\) no está contenida: su punto \\((4,3,5)\\) da \\(8+6-5=9\\neq0\\). Es paralela al plano.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}